AV/GARDEN
=========

AV/GARDEN is based on and continues work from:

  NASSAV
  https://github.com/Satoing/NASSAV
  Copyright (c) 2025 satoing
  Licensed under the MIT License

The original NASSAV project provides the foundation for the downloader,
metadata scraping flow, queue-oriented operation, and NAS deployment ideas.

AV/GARDEN keeps the upstream MIT license notice and evolves the project with
additional Web UI, qBittorrent-first download handling, weekly recommendations,
download management, search, status visibility, and deployment documentation.

Additional acknowledgement:

  m3u8-Downloader-Go
  https://github.com/Greyh4t/m3u8-Downloader-Go

This notice is provided to make the upstream source and acknowledgements clear
for users, contributors, and automated agents reading this repository.
